  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/P1170552.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) El Grup Scout Sant&iacute;ssim Salvador d&#39;Onda ha celebrat aquest&nbsp;cap de setmana,&nbsp;26 i 27 de setembre, l&#39;inici de la Ronda Solar i de les activitats d&#39;aquest curs amb una acampada al paratge del Salvador, on han arribat &nbsp;en una marxa des de la Font de Dins.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170544.jpg\" alt=\"p1170544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170547.jpg\" alt=\"p1170547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170548.jpg\" alt=\"p1170548\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170549.jpg\" alt=\"p1170549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170552.jpg\" alt=\"p1170552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170553.jpg\" alt=\"p1170553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170554.jpg\" alt=\"p1170554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170555.jpg\" alt=\"p1170555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsacampadarondasolar/p1170556.jpg\" alt=\"p1170556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=